Adobe MCP: one-click installer and control panel

A single double-clickable .app that lets Claude and ChatGPT drive
Illustrator, After Effects, Premiere Pro, Photoshop and InDesign.
Node, uv and the adb-mcp engine are bundled, so there is nothing
for the user to install.

- hub.js       control panel + socket.io command proxy in one process
- index.html   the dashboard: per-app status, one-click setup
- build.sh     downloads the runtimes and packs dist/Adobe MCP.app

Illustrator and After Effects install fully automatically. Photoshop,
Premiere and InDesign need one Load click in Adobe UXP Developer
Tool, because Adobe rejects unsigned UXP packages.

